sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Producer
  participant Q as Queue (RabbitMQ)
  participant W as Worker
  Note left of P: Batch size: 500
  loop every 30 s
    P->>Q: publish(batch)
    Q->>W: deliver
    W->>W: process items
    opt item failed
      W--xQ: nack + requeue
    end
    W-->>Q: ack
  end
  par audit
    W->>P: progress report
  and metrics
    W->>Q: heartbeat
  end
  Note right of W: Worker restarts on OOM
